// [EN] Swift Package Manager module map of the CYLAnimatedItem target. The headers stay where CocoaPods and Carthage
//      expect them; this folder links to them, and `header` lists the public ones.
// [CN] CYLAnimatedItem target 的 Swift Package Manager module map。头文件保留在 CocoaPods 与 Carthage 期望的位置；本目录用链接指向它们，`header` 列出公开头文件。
